NODE id=matrix/executor/internal/snapshot.Manager.tick kind=method
  digest=b3:937fd98cae4003a9c674b8f83ddb80fff0ae4ebd05e163ab7ded59e0f6162ab0 file=executor/internal/snapshot/snapshot.go range=459:484 lang=go exported=false byte_range=15494:16305
  sig=func (m *Manager) tick(parent context.Context, interval time.Duration)
  doc=tick runs until ctx is cancelled OR Stop closes stopCh, then closes\ndoneCh and exits. Each tick fires Push with a fresh per-tick context\nderived from the parent so a long-running upload that misses the next\ntick doesn't block the ticker (each Push contends pushMu — slow\nuploads delay the next attempt rather than overlapping).
EDGES
